      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo enteko eguma, egira n'emilembe omuli Buyahudi yona na Galilaya na Samaria. Abaikiliize batina Omukama, mara omu mani ga Mwoyo Mutakatifu beyongera kukanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero yagya buli hantu, narambura abaikiliza bona. Limoi yagya na Lida kuleba abatakatifu bayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashangayo omushaija eibaralye Enea, amazire emyaka munaana ataimuka hansi, akabire orubaju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amugambira ati, “Enea, Yesu Kirisito yakukiza; imuka oyare ekitanda kyawe.” Aho honkai Enea aimuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bona abaturaga Lida na Sharoni kabamuboine besiga Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Yopa hakaba halimu omwegesibwa nayetwa Tabita, omu Rugiriki n'iwe Dorika (nikwo kugamba Kasa). Omukazi ogwo yajunaga muno abantu n'abanaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebyo arwara, afa. Kabamazire kumwogya bamuteka omu gorofa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lida ekaba eyataine Yopa. Abegesibwa bahulira okwo Petero ali Lida, bamutumaho abantu babili nibamutagiliza k'ayanguha akaija Yopa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Petero aimukya agenda nabo. Orwo yagobaireyo bamutwara omu gorofa. Entumbwa zona zimwemelera aha rubaju nizichura. Bamwoleka amashati n'ebijwaro ebindi ebyo Dorika yakoraga ainabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Petero aturukya entumbwa zona, abandama, ashoma enshara. Ashuba ahindukira omutumbi agamba ati, “Tabita, imuka.” Tabita aburura; kayamazire kubona Petero, ashuntama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero akwata Tabita omu ngaro, amwemeleza. Aho ayeta abaikiliza n'entumbwakazi amubaha narora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo ekyo kimanyika omuli Yopa yona, abantu bangi besiga Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Yopa Petero akamaramu ebiro bingi. Yaikaraga omwa Simoni omuhazi w'empu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
